2026-09-19  JJ

	* ixpipe-handler.c: Check both lseek() operations used by
	  ACTION_SEEK and translate failures to DOS errors. Bound the
	  ACTION_EXAMINE_FH BSTR filename to the available FileInfoBlock
	  storage. Harden signal recovery so that a NULL or already returned
	  DosPacket is not dereferenced.

	* localtime.c: Update the timezone implementation from tzcode 7.61
	  to 7.75. Add validation of TZif counts, record indexes and input
	  lengths, default DST rules, the re-entrant localtime_r(), gmtime_r()
	  and ctime_r() interfaces, and improved leap-second and mktime()
	  handling.

	* util.c: Check settings-file reads and writes, reject incompatible
	  settings versions, fall back to defaults for invalid settings, and
	  correct requester error formatting.

	* ixstack.c: Correct mmap() failure handling, use a writable mapping,
	  release mappings on every exit path, avoid uninitialized descriptor
	  use, and replace implementation-dependent multi-character constants
	  with explicit 32-bit values.

	* ixtimezone.c: Store IXGMTOFFSET in an explicit five-byte format,
	  remove structure-padding and byte-order dependencies, use the Amiga
	  epoch constant, validate time conversion results, and make
	  battclock.resource patch installation and removal safer.

	* ixtrace.c: Replace unbounded interactive input, make SIGINT state
	  signal-safe, correct trace-output length handling, and bound syscall
	  formatting to the output buffer.

	* ixtrace.h: Synchronize the trace table with the new
	  ixemul.library v80 system-call interfaces.

	* amiga_gui.c: Correct pointer values passed through GadTools tag
	  lists and simplify equivalent array-address expressions.

	* ixrun.c: Correct Unix-style /volume/path conversion without
	  modifying argv[] or its strings, and correct allocation diagnostics.
